forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":".  Just glanced through dark era's 05-29-2018, 11:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-29T20:26:12-07:00","id":1223098,"title":"","content":"Not the Dark Eras we have, Dark Eras 2 which was funded in Kickstarter. They will include an Arthurian Britain era. The Bron will be in it","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-29T20:37:21-07:00","id":1223101,"title":"","content":"It seems like a sufficiently unique enough situation that you can just make your own Merit for it that works for your game. Working undercover in two covenants isn't exactly easy with such a small population, especially one that is only active half the time and nearly everyone has access to a secret or lie detector ability.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-29T21:23:18-07:00","id":1223104,"title":"","content":"and in the coteries book Crone infiltrators were usualy leaving the covenant basicly for the time being often going to another domain... only to attempt sabotage, and come back decades latter with info.<br /> <br /> One thing I wondered on that... is why Stolen magic's dont spread father... ideas? <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 05-30-2018, 12:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-29T21:30:50-07:00","id":1223107,"title":"","content":"Which would, in play, probably be represented more like Sanctity of Merits, losing your Crone Status and putting it somewhere else, rather than being in two covenants.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-29T21:33:05-07:00","id":1223108,"title":"","content":"with it being a mentor you give reports to, and who will help you to regain your status?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-29T22:33:48-07:00","id":1223119,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1222546-multi-covenant-membership?p=1223108#post1223108\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">with it being a mentor you give reports to, and who will help you to regain your status?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sanctity of Merits again. You lose your 'undercover' Merits and put it back to the Crone. You likely have more Experiences to spend elsewhere, and if you choose to put not as much back into Crone Status it could be because people don't trust you as much after your long absence spent with enemies, or if you choose to have more it could be because what you did really propelled you upward.<br /> <br /> But this is a really specific kind of case. And if you WANT a Merit that lets you have Status in two covenants, or be undercover, you can make one. It's the benefit of the toolbox approach. When you say things like, 'I wish they would make a Merit like this,' you can just make it yourself and no one's going to call you out for not working in the game.<br /> <br /> Sleeper (\u2022-\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022)<br /> <b>Prerequisites</b>: Resolve 2, Composure 3, Covenant Status \u2022+, Mentor \u2022+<br /> <b>Effect</b>: You have undergone training to go undercover in another covenant, including psychological schooling, supernatural stressors, and breaking away from your previous life. You may convert any dots of Status in your true Covenant to work in your cover covenant.<br /> In addition, your dots in Sleeper can be added to any dicepool to defend your loyalties to your cover covenant. Using Sleeper to defend this way against supernatural scrutinization to find your true loyalty requires the expenditure of a Willpower point.<br /> <b>Drawback</b>: Members of your former covenant treat you as if you have the Betrayer Condition. Your Mentor is the only one who knows the truth and can vouch for the fact that you are still loyal to your true covenant. If something happens to them, the Betrayer Condition becomes Persistent.<br /> <br /> Betrayed (can be Persistent)<br /> You've betrayed an entire covenant and they are not pleased with it. If you run into them they are likely to use anything they can against you, including things once thought to be secret. Some may want to put you into the Final Death, others may want to tear away at the nice touches you've made to your unlife, ruining Touchstones. Others may take it out on your living relatives.<br /> <b>Beat</b>: The ones you betrayed do something puts you in danger, ruins your plans or harm one of your touchstones. Alternatively you can gain a Beat by playing up your new cover and using your knowledge to put them in danger, ruin their plans, or harm one of their touchstones.<br /> <b>Resolution</b>: Gain a Beat by convincing them of the truth of your undercover mission, doing this lowers the dot value of your Sleeper Merit's benefit by 1 for each resolution.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 05-30-2018, 02:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-29T22:53:34-07:00","id":1223123,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1222546-multi-covenant-membership?p=1223104#post1223104\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One thing I wondered on that... is why Stolen magic's dont spread father... ideas?</div> </div> </div> </div>Strix and the curse of the lone ritualist outside the covenant that's the least shy about spilling buckets of blood on magical endeavors, oathbound entry requirements in a covenant that can magically find oathbreakers and has firm ideas about secrecy, and rigorous soul-flensing study in a covenant that has an entire wing devoted to violent cleanup of leaked secrets, to address the big three. These aren't exactly lifehacks you're talking about here \u2014 it's vampire magic, and that means there's a cost that makes it jealously guarded as a matter of course.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-30T04:06:15-07:00","id":1223152,"title":"","content":"Open dual membership in the Circle and LS would likely require the two Covenants to work closely together for whatever reason. A third Covenant bringing them together politically (as mentioned by earlier posts) could be a first step towards that.<br /> Another way/step could be to eliminate the religious differences between the two. Look to Santa Muerte in Mexico. The Catholic church should by any accounts consider worship of Santa Muerte as heresy, but since it's so accepted by people who has incorporated that into their own theology, the church has opted to just call it &quot;heterodoxy&quot; and condemning the practice instead of the practitioners. This could continue into undeath, with condemned Cr\u00faac rituals being performed to honour Santa Muerte (aka the Crone) by Kindred who still considers themselves part of the Lancea et Sanctum, and the Lancea clergy might not dare to do anything because then they'd lose a significant portion of their flocks.<br /> It could also happen in Kindred culture without basing it on human culture. Imagine a region where oral traditions has become just as important to the laity (and possibly clergy) as the written Testament. These oral traditions have added another figure into the story of Longinus. God cursed Longinus and tasked him to be the evil that befalls Mankind, yet God is good so God couldn't have taught Longinus how to be that evil. Instead Longinus was approached by a hooded figure (the Crone) who taught him to become the monster that God needs him to be. And in modern nights this has developed to the Circle and the Lance working side by side, one granting Kindred the power of the Beast, and the other helping Kindred retain their grasp on their Humanity.<br /> <br /> I think these regional variations in the two Covenants are necessary for a dual membership to work. While Circle of the Crone could theoretically appropriate any other religion (human or Kindred) due to them not having any actual organisation, the Lancea et Sanctum is an organised church and something needs to change for them before they can allow members to practice other religions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-30T04:09:00-07:00","id":1223153,"title":"","content":"was kind of thinking it would be cool for an Egyptian Pagan covenant to have theban sorcery.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-30T04:23:19-07:00","id":1223156,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1222546-multi-covenant-membership?p=1223153#post1223153\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">was kind of thinking it would be cool for an Egyptian Pagan covenant to have theban sorcery.</div> </div> </div> </div>You can probably have it so, the Lances didn't create the sorcery. It was already there in Thebes. The question is whether they found it in ruins like that 2e core and Lances book suggests or they learned it from the natives like the Testament of Longinus says. If they were taught then it probably would have been by some Mekhet. So you can have a group or bloodline along those lines","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-