bond's a Sanctified Crusader, hows it effect his personality, whats left alone by the bond?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 05-30-2018, 08:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-30T05:51:07-07:00","id":1223182,"title":"","content":"We're planning a historical campaign for vampire starting year 410. One of my character ideas is a young Mekhet (with a torpid Bak-Ra as Sire, will either start as Bak-Ra just waking up from torpor or using the torpid Sire to become Bak-Ra during play) tasked by the survivors of the Great Covenant to join the Lancea et Sanctum in order to keep an eye on those who stole the miracles of Ra. Long term goal would be to convert a sizeable portion of Lancea to the Cult of Ra, but as a player I realise it's basically impossible and at most it might create a bastard hybrid of LS and the Cult of Ra.